; Vulkan memory model: release store / acquire load, a device-scope memory barrier and a workgroup one,
; and a store with MakePointerAvailable / a load with MakePointerVisible (scope Device).
OpCapability Cap:Shader
OpCapability Cap:VulkanMemoryModel
OpCapability Cap:VulkanMemoryModelDeviceScope
OpExtension "SPV_KHR_vulkan_memory_model"
OpMemoryModel AddrModel:Logical MemModel:Vulkan
OpEntryPoint Model:GLCompute %main "main"
OpExecutionMode %main ExecMode:LocalSize 1 1 1
OpDecorate %blk Deco:Block
OpMemberDecorate %blk 0 Deco:Offset 0
OpMemberDecorate %blk 1 Deco:Offset 4
OpDecorate %buf Deco:DescriptorSet 0
OpDecorate %buf Deco:Binding 0
%void = OpTypeVoid
%fn = OpTypeFunction %void
%u32 = OpTypeInt 32 0
%c0 = OpConstant %u32 0
%c1 = OpConstant %u32 1
%dev = OpConstant %u32 1
%wg = OpConstant %u32 2
%semrel = OpConstant %u32 68
%semacq = OpConstant %u32 66
%semrelwg = OpConstant %u32 260
%blk = OpTypeStruct %u32 %u32
%pblk = OpTypePointer Storage:StorageBuffer %blk
%pu = OpTypePointer Storage:StorageBuffer %u32
%buf = OpVariable %pblk Storage:StorageBuffer
%main = OpFunction %void 0 %fn
%l = OpLabel
%pdata = OpAccessChain %pu %buf %c0
%pflag = OpAccessChain %pu %buf %c1
OpStore %pdata %c1 MemAccess:NonPrivatePointer|MemAccess:MakePointerAvailable %dev
OpAtomicStore %pflag %dev %semrel %c1
%f = OpAtomicLoad %u32 %pflag %dev %semacq
OpMemoryBarrier %dev %semrel
OpMemoryBarrier %wg %semrelwg
%d = OpLoad %u32 %pdata MemAccess:NonPrivatePointer|MemAccess:MakePointerVisible %dev
OpStore %pdata %d
OpReturn
OpFunctionEnd
